{"id":"69f8bfb0b4c6f71c","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-WKL-conservative.md","title":"Pi-Zero-Two Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0","display":"thm-WKL-conservative — Pi-Zero-Two Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-WKL-conservative","aliases":["62-thm-WKL-conservative"],"display":"thm-WKL-conservative — Pi-Zero-Two Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0","depends_on":["[[62-df-WKL0]]","[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-thm-WKL0-conservative]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Corollary IX.2.6 (arithmetical fragment)","source_pages":[368],"source_pdf_pages":[386]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-WKL-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-WKL-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-WKL-conservative — Pi-Zero-Two Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9fbacb16db1e028f\" href=\"?note=9fbacb16db1e028f\" title=\"62-thm-WKL0-conservative\">62-thm-WKL0-conservative</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Corollary IX.2.6 (arithmetical fragment)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>368</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>386</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_2(S_2)\">\\(\\Pi^0_2(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a>，句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>；Conservative 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。更强保守性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9fbacb16db1e028f\" href=\"?note=9fbacb16db1e028f\" title=\"62-thm-WKL0-conservative\">62-thm-WKL0-conservative</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Pi^0_2(S_2)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Pi^0_2(S_2)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一个闭算术句子可加未使用的全称集合量词，得到逻辑等价的 Π¹₁ 句子，因此由 IX.2.6 推出。保留此旧节点作为较弱片段的推论，并指向主保守性定理。书中还证明 WKL₀ 对 PRA 的 Π⁰₂ 保守性，但这里没有把 RCA₀ 替换为未定义的 PRA。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Corollary IX.2.6 (arithmetical fragment)；纸面页 368；PDF 页 386。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-WKL0-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"9fbacb16db1e028f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-WKL0-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":